    "content": "<h1 dir=\"auto\">宇宙航线：REAREye独家</h1>\n<h1 dir=\"auto\">热烈祝贺「宇宙航线」在小米7月背屏创意设计大赛中获得「背屏银奖」！</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://gh-proxy.org/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SiberiaApp/yuzhouhangxian/refs/heads/main/hetu.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/cb607b9d563321b526ba3b94be6fa414ed4207a1a3dcf02ab6632ea515d77959/68747470733a2f2f67682d70726f78792e6f72672f68747470733a2f2f7261772e67697468756275736572636f6e74656e742e636f6d2f536962657269614170702f79757a686f7568616e677869616e2f726566732f68656164732f6d61696e2f686574752e706e67\" alt=\"\" data-canonical-src=\"https://gh-proxy.org/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SiberiaApp/yuzhouhangxian/refs/heads/main/hetu.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://gh-proxy.org/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SiberiaApp/yuzhouhangxian/refs/heads/main/haibao.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/15666521014e85ed408fd5853eb7a7d42893aff4cf6942725d859a86dd26caed/68747470733a2f2f67682d70726f78792e6f72672f68747470733a2f2f7261772e67697468756275736572636f6e74656e742e636f6d2f536962657269614170702f79757a686f7568616e677869616e2f726566732f68656164732f6d61696e2f68616962616f2e706e67\" alt=\"\" data-canonical-src=\"https://gh-proxy.org/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SiberiaApp/yuzhouhangxian/refs/heads/main/haibao.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">从此刻的坐标出发，向未知的星域航行。以星图与轨道为灵感，构建「宇宙航线」。通过留白与轨道元素的呼应，在保留信息显示空间的同时，营造简洁而富有秩序感的画面。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">与小米7月背屏创意设计大赛获奖作品——宇宙航线作者hrsthrt74独家合作，实现了AOD界面下显示深色版本，并首次以MAML的形式实现了背屏充电动画，仅在REAREye独家上线！</p>"
